data: {"id":1104,"ts":"2026-10-23T23:20:04.245014+00:00","type":"tool_finished","payload":{"tool":"synth_stats","tool_call_id":"42227579997147e684f8418aa4506829","result":{"ok":true,"cell_count":60,"area_estimate":null,"log_path":"/Users/siyoungpark/Documents/GitHub/Meta-global-ai-developer-hackathon-2026/runs/8e898b2c1a9b4788835ef6f9edf0f03e/work/.eda/synth_f7a5bbe94ee84fdbb49ccb02ecfc4525/output/tool.log","stats_path":"/Users/siyoungpark/Documents/GitHub/Meta-global-ai-developer-hackathon-2026/runs/8e898b2c1a9b4788835ef6f9edf0f03e/work/.eda/synth_f7a5bbe94ee84fdbb49ccb02ecfc4525/output/synth.json","summary":"Output truncated; full EDA logs remain on disk.","log_tail":"[truncated 8228 bytes; showing tail]\n               NOT cells:        4\nABC RESULTS:                OR cells:        5\nABC RESULTS:             ORNOT cells:        2\nABC RESULTS:              XNOR cells:        1\nABC RESULTS:               XOR cells:        5\nABC RESULTS:        internal signals:       26\nABC RESULTS:           input signals:       27\nABC RESULTS:          output signals:       23\nRemoving temp directory.\nRemoving global temp directory.\n\n2.23. Executing OPT pass (performing simple optimizations).\n\n2.23.1. Executing OPT_EXPR pass (perform const folding).\nOptimizing module uart_tx.\n<suppressed ~2 debug messages>\n\n2.23.2. Executing OPT_MERGE pass (detect identical cells).\nFinding identical cells in module `\\uart_tx'.\nComputing hashes of 60 cells of `\\uart_tx'.\nFinding duplicate cells in `\\uart_tx'.\nRemoved a total of 0 cells.\n\n2.23.3. Executing OPT_DFF pass (perform DFF optimizations).\n\n2.23.4. Executing OPT_CLEAN pass (remove unused cells and wires).\nFinding unused cells or wires in module \\uart_tx..\nRemoved 0 unused cells and 64 unused wires.\n<suppressed ~1 debug messages>\n\n2.23.5. Finished fast OPT passes.\n\n2.24. Executing HIERARCHY pass (managing design hierarchy).\nAttribute `top' found on module `uart_tx'. Setting top module to uart_tx.\n\n2.24.1. Analyzing design hierarchy..\nTop module:  \\uart_tx\n\n2.24.2. Analyzing design hierarchy..\nTop module:  \\uart_tx\nRemoved 0 unused modules.\n\n2.25. Printing statistics.\n\n=== uart_tx ===\n\n        +----------Local Count, excluding submodules.\n        | \n       47 wires\n       80 wire bits\n        9 public wires\n       30 public wire bits\n        6 ports\n       13 port bits\n       60 cells\n        9   $_ANDNOT_\n        2   $_AND_\n        9   $_MUX_\n        4   $_NAND_\n        1   $_NOR_\n        4   $_NOT_\n        2   $_ORNOT_\n        5   $_OR_\n        4   $_SDFFE_PN0P_\n        9   $_SDFFE_PN1P_\n        1   $_SDFF_PN0_\n        4   $_SDFF_PP0_\n        1   $_XNOR_\n        5   $_XOR_\n\n2.26. Executing CHECK pass (checking for obvious problems).\nChecking module uart_tx...\nFound and reported 0 problems.\n{\n   \"creator\": \"Yosys 0.62 (git sha1 7326bb7d6641500ecb285c291a54a662cb1e76cf, clang++ 21.1.2 -fPIC -O3)\",\n   \"invocation\": \"stat -json \",\n   \"modules\": {\n      \"\\\\uart_tx\": {\n         \"num_wires\":         47,\n         \"num_wire_bits\":     80,\n         \"num_pub_wires\":     9,\n         \"num_pub_wire_bits\": 30,\n         \"num_ports\":         6,\n         \"num_port_bits\":     13,\n         \"num_memories\":      0,\n         \"num_memory_bits\":   0,\n         \"num_processes\":     0,\n         \"num_cells\":         60,\n         \"num_submodules\":       0,\n         \"num_cells_by_type\": {\n            \"$_ANDNOT_\": 9,\n            \"$_AND_\": 2,\n            \"$_MUX_\": 9,\n            \"$_NAND_\": 4,\n            \"$_NOR_\": 1,\n            \"$_NOT_\": 4,\n            \"$_ORNOT_\": 2,\n            \"$_OR_\": 5,\n            \"$_SDFFE_PN0P_\": 4,\n            \"$_SDFFE_PN1P_\": 9,\n            \"$_SDFF_PN0_\": 1,\n            \"$_SDFF_PP0_\": 4,\n            \"$_XNOR_\": 1,\n            \"$_XOR_\": 5\n         }\n      }\n   },\n      \"design\": {\n         \"num_wires\":         47,\n         \"num_wire_bits\":     80,\n         \"num_pub_wires\":     9,\n         \"num_pub_wire_bits\": 30,\n         \"num_ports\":         6,\n         \"num_port_bits\":     13,\n         \"num_memories\":      0,\n         \"num_memory_bits\":   0,\n         \"num_processes\":     0,\n         \"num_cells\":         60,\n         \"num_submodules\":       0,\n         \"num_cells_by_type\": {\n            \"$_ANDNOT_\": 9,\n            \"$_AND_\": 2,\n            \"$_MUX_\": 9,\n            \"$_NAND_\": 4,\n            \"$_NOR_\": 1,\n            \"$_NOT_\": 4,\n            \"$_ORNOT_\": 2,\n            \"$_OR_\": 5,\n            \"$_SDFFE_PN0P_\": 4,\n            \"$_SDFFE_PN1P_\": 9,\n            \"$_SDFF_PN0_\": 1,\n            \"$_SDFF_PP0_\": 4,\n            \"$_XNOR_\": 1,\n            \"$_XOR_\": 5\n         }\n      }\n}\n\nEnd of script. Logfile hash: def713bf9e, CPU: user 0.04s system 0.01s, MEM: 28.46 MB peak\nYosys 0.62 (git sha1 7326bb7d6641500ecb285c291a54a662cb1e76cf, clang++ 21.1.2 -fPIC -O3)\nTime spent: 49% 1x abc (0 sec), 14% 19x opt_expr (0 sec), ...\n"}}}

