.ReportManufacturability' at            step.py:1138\n               'runs/flow_af021e33756f409f/76-misc-reportmanufactur             \n               ability'…                                                        \n[23:20:52] [I] Saving views to                                      state.py:209\n               '/output/runs/flow_af021e33756f409f/final'…                      \n[23:20:52] [I] Flow complete.                                  sequential.py:413\n\n\n[23:20:52] [W] The following warnings were generated by the flow:    flow.py:699\n[23:20:52] [W] [OpenROAD.CheckSDCFiles] 'PNR_SDC_FILE' is not        flow.py:701\n               defined. Using generic fallback SDC for OpenROAD PnR             \n               steps.                                                           \n[23:20:52] [W] [OpenROAD.CheckSDCFiles] 'SIGNOFF_SDC_FILE' is not    flow.py:701\n               defined. Using generic fallback SDC for OpenROAD PnR             \n               steps.                                                           \n[23:20:52] [W] [OpenROAD.RepairDesignPostGPL] [STA-1140]             flow.py:701\n               /pdk/sky130A/libs.ref/sky130_fd_sc_hd/lib/sky130_fd_s            \n               c_hd__tt_025C_1v80.lib line 1, library                           \n               sky130_fd_sc_hd__tt_025C_1v80 already exists. (and 17            \n               similar warnings)                                                \n[23:20:52] [W] [OpenROAD.RepairDesignPostGPL] [RSZ-0020] found 2     flow.py:701\n               floating nets.                                                   \n[23:20:52] [W] [OpenROAD.DetailedRouting] [DRT-0349] LEF58_ENCLOSURE flow.py:701\n               with no CUTCLASS is not supported. Skipping for layer            \n               mcon (and 9 similar warnings)                                    \n[23:20:52] [W] [Checker.WireLength] Threshold for                    flow.py:701\n               Threshold-surpassing long wires is not set. The                  \n               checker will be skipped.                                         \n[23:20:52] [W] [OpenROAD.IRDropReport] 'VSRC_LOC_FILES' was not      flow.py:701\n               given a value, which may make the results of IR drop             \n               analysis inaccurate. If you are not integrating a                \n               top-level chip for manufacture, you may ignore this              \n               warning, otherwise, see the documentation for                    \n               'VSRC_LOC_FILES'.                                                \n[23:20:52] [W] [Checker.MaxSlewViolations] Max Slew violations found flow.py:701\n               in the following corners:                                        \n               * max_ss_100C_1v60                                               \n"}}}

