id: 1117
event: note
data: {"id":1117,"ts":"2026-10-23T23:21:03.045453+00:00","type":"note","payload":{"text":"Compare three configuration-only variants of the verified RTL, all with CLOCK_PERIOD=20 ns: A uses SYNTH_STRATEGY='AREA 0' and PL_TARGET_DENSITY_PCT=40 to explore area-oriented synthesis with relaxed placement; B uses SYNTH_STRATEGY='AREA 3' and PL_TARGET_DENSITY_PCT=50 to compare another area strategy at moderate density; C uses SYNTH_STRATEGY='DELAY 0' and PL_TARGET_DENSITY_PCT=60 to assess timing-oriented synthesis and denser placement. Keep source, tests, and config.json unchanged before this batch. Rank actual results by meeting 50 MHz with WNS>=0, then lower stdcell area, then lower reported power; tile fit remains unverified."}}

